      "content": "Dear Museum Community,\n\nAs stewards of cultural heritage, our decisions greatly impact our universal collection and the objects that intimately tell the stories of many civilizations. This document seeks to contemplate the significance, ethical considerations, and practical implications of returning artifacts to their countries of origin versus retaining them as part of our shared global heritage. \n\nWe invite you to engage in a thoughtful discourse and contribute to forming a path forward that honors cultural identities, promotes mutual respect, and further enriches our universal collection. Let this be an opportunity to reflect, collaborate, and redefine the future of our museum's collection policy.\n\nRespectfully,\nThe Museum Policy Committee",
